# themes/dark — static Catppuccin-Mocha-flavoured dark palette.
#
# Generated by scripts/theme/colorgen.sh from a seed image built out of
# Catppuccin Mocha's base/blue/red/green, then committed as a static
# palette. Produced by the real engine rather than hand-written hex, so
# it is guaranteed to parse and to carry every key a template can
# reference (89 dcol_* entries).
#
# Applied with:  scripts/theme/theme-apply.sh dark
# Dark only — this project has no light mode. See CREDITS.md.
#
